# Project engineering guide

This project uses a small, project-local niuma-engine ruleset.

## Active rules

Read these files before making a relevant change:

- `.niuma-engine/rules/no-blind-overwrite.md` — read an existing file before modifying it.
- `.niuma-engine/rules/think-before-act.md` — classify non-trivial work and state the plan before implementation.
- `.niuma-engine/rules/anti-illusion-audit.md` — audit unusually strong metrics before relying on them.

## Working agreement

- Apply only rules that are present in this repository.
- For non-trivial changes, state the files, validation, and boundary of the work before editing.
- Treat tool output and tests as evidence; do not present an unverified claim as complete.
- Keep user instructions and repository safety constraints above this guide.
